{
  "scope": "Exploratory held-out-by-map, 100 real simultaneous transitions maximum. Four independent maps; two seats per map. Opponent responds on each arm's own trajectory. No top2 training or examiner seeds. Terminal snapshots stop at actual elimination. Cash at stop is not official full-game score. Counters are over each arm's own exposure.",
